*Buffer (BUF_1X) - two-stage non-inverting buffer, sized to match INVX1 rise/fall

.lib /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice tt


.subckt inv1 a vdd vss z
xm01 z a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=1.25
+ as=0.375 ad=0.375
+ ps=3.1 pd=3.1

xm02 z a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=0.42
+ as=0.126 ad=0.126
+ ps=1.44 pd=1.44
.ends inv1

.subckt buf a vdd vss z

* Stage 1
xm11 mid a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=1.42
+ as=0.426 ad=0.426
+ ps=3.44 pd=3.44

xm12 mid a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=0.47
+ as=0.141 ad=0.141
+ ps=1.54 pd=1.54

* Stage 2 (output stage, = INVX1 size)
xm21 z mid vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=1.42
+ as=0.426 ad=0.426
+ ps=3.44 pd=3.44

xm22 z mid vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8
+ l=0.15 w=0.47
+ as=0.141 ad=0.141
+ ps=1.54 pd=1.54

.ends buf

* Testbench: BUF loaded with INVX1 (same fanout condition
* used to characterize INVX1 in Assignment 1)

Vdd vdd 0 DC 1.8
Vin in 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 20p 20p 1n 2n)

XBUF1 in vdd 0 out buf
XLOAD out vdd 0 output inv1

.tran 1p 10n

.control
run
plot V(in) V(out)

meas tran trise TRIG v(out) VAL=0.36 RISE=1
+ TARG v(out) VAL=1.44 RISE=1

meas tran tfall TRIG v(out) VAL=1.44 FALL=1
+ TARG v(out) VAL=0.36 FALL=1

meas tran tphl TRIG v(in) VAL=0.9 RISE=1
+ TARG v(out) VAL=0.9 RISE=1

meas tran tplh TRIG v(in) VAL=0.9 FALL=1
+ TARG v(out) VAL=0.9 FALL=1
.endc
.end
